# Plain-text CVs/job descriptions, tabular exports and credential JSON can have arbitrary names.
# Only dependency lists and reviewed synthetic fixtures are public exceptions.
*.txt
!requirements*.txt
!tests/fixtures/**/*.txt
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xls
*.xlsx
*.json
!tests/fixtures/*.json
